OL,3,AAustralia 'outraged' after Israeli
OL,4,Adecision not to prosecute over killing
OL,5,Aof aid worker in Gaza
OL,6,
OL,7,FForeign Minister Penny Wong said the
OL,8,Fdecision "falls far short of the
OL,9,Faccountability we expect" and that she
OL,10,Fwould call in the Israeli ambassador.
OL,12,FAustralia would continue pressing
OL,13,FIsrael "for justice for Zomi and her
OL,14,Fcolleagues", she said in a statement on
OL,15,FThursday.
